The Go rendering: a command printing a line whose fields have a Format and a
GoString method under %v and %#v, a struct whose unexported field holds a
struct, a type with GoString under %v, a struct whose interface field holds a
value with String, a struct whose field has String under %d, a type with
GoString under four spellings of the # flag on v and under %#x, and a
reflect.Value of a struct.

